<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Velnora Finance</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="banner">Demo project — fictional bank for coursework</div>
  <% if (loggedIn) { %>
    <%- include('partials/app-header') %>
  <% } else { %>
    <%- include('partials/public-nav') %>
  <% } %>

  <section class="privacy-hero">
    <img src="/images/privacy.png" alt="Privacy Policy" class="privacy-hero-image">
    <div class="privacy-hero-overlay">
      <h1>Our Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Your privacy is important to us. This policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.</p>
    </div>
 </section>

  <section class="privacy-intro">
    <div class="privacy-intro-inner">
      <h2>We're in the business of keeping your money and private information safe.</h2>
      <p>Your trust is our highest priority. We use advanced security, strong encryption, continuous fraud monitoring, and strict privacy standards to protect your money and personal information. Every transaction is secured, and your data is handled responsibly to ensure a safe, reliable, and confident banking experience.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-history">
    <div class="privacy-history-inner">
      <div class="privacy-history-image">
        <img src="/images/2.png" alt="Our History">
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-history-text">
        <div class="privacy-history-tag">DATA PROCESSING</div>
        <h2>How we collect your information online</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide when you create an account, complete forms, contact us, or use our online banking services. We also collect certain technical information automatically, such as your IP address, browser type, device information, cookies, and activity on our website, to improve security, enhance your experience, and ensure our digital services operate efficiently. All information is collected responsibly and in accordance with applicable privacy and data protection laws.</p>
      <p class="privacy-note">
        <em>
   This Privacy Policy applies to information we collect when you use our Online Services. We may combine that information with information we collect from other online and offline sources, such as from our phone calls and emails with you, from third-party data sources for fraud prevention, identity verification, or marketing purposes, from our co-branded card or business partners, and from publicly available data sources. We will treat such combined information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
          </em>
</p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-leadership"> 
    <div class="privacy-leadership-inner">
      <div class="privacy-leadership-image">
        <img src="/images/1.png" alt="Our Leadership">
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-leadership-text">
        <div class="privacy-leadership-tag">INFORMATION COLLECTION</div>
        <h2>What Type of Information Do We Collect?</h2>
        <p>We collect the information necessary to provide and improve our banking services. This may include personal details such as your name, email address, phone number, mailing address, date of birth, and government-issued identification when required. We also collect financial information, including account details, transaction history, payment information, and records of your interactions with us. In addition, we may gather technical data such as your IP address, device information, browser type, location data (where permitted), and website usage patterns to enhance security, prevent fraud, and deliver a more personalized online banking experience. All information is collected, stored, and processed in accordance with applicable privacy and data protection laws.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-commitment"> 
    <div class="privacy-commitment-inner">
      <div class="privacy-commitment-image">
        <img src="/images/3.png" alt="Our commitment">
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-commitment-text">
        <div class="privacy-commitment-tag">YOUR PRIVACY IS OUR PRIORITY</div>
        <h2>How We Protect Your Information</h2>
        <p>Protecting your personal and financial information is one of our highest priorities. We use industry-standard security measures, including data encryption, secure servers, firewalls, multi-factor authentication, and continuous fraud monitoring to safeguard your information from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or disclosure. Access to customer information is restricted to authorized personnel who require it to perform their responsibilities, and we regularly review and update our security practices to address emerging threats. While no online system can guarantee absolute security, we are committed to maintaining strong safeguards to help ensure your information remains secure whenever you use our services.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


<!-- CTA BANNER -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
    <p>Create your free account and see your dashboard in under a minute.</p>
    <a href="/create-account" class="btn-hero-primary">Create Account</a>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="site-footer">

    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">VELNORA FINANCE</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Help and Support</a>
        <a href="/login">Log In</a>
        <a href="/create-account">Create Account</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-note">&copy; 2026 Velnora Finance. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <% if (loggedIn) { %>
    <%- include('partials/bottom-nav') %>
  <% } %>
</body>
</html>